@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+---
+id: task-001-add-in-memory-rental-service
+type: task
+title: "Add in-memory rental service"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented the in-memory rental service exported from `src/index.ts`.
+
+The service validates equipment and UTC whole-day requests, calculates integer-cent totals, prevents
+overlapping bookings of one item, and creates sequential booking IDs. Added deterministic automated
+tests, TypeScript build tooling, and README usage documentation. Cancellations are intentionally not
+implemented.
